      "x": 534,
      "y": 293,
      "width": 512,
      "height": 38,
      "text": "Shadow's brain and memory. Has no window: it keeps working when\nevery window is closed.",
      "originalText": "Shadow's brain and memory. Has no window: it keeps working when\nevery window is closed.",
