      "y": 2152,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "Before (up to milestone 5)",
      "originalText": "Before (up to milestone 5)",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_175",
      "x": 94,
      "y": 2181.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "• The daemon lived in a terminal: close it and Shadow\nstops.",
      "originalText": "• The daemon lived in a terminal: close it and Shadow\nstops.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_176",
      "x": 94,
      "y": 2224.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "• An approval, a question or a stuck run waited on the\nterminal's keyboard (a promise in memory).",
      "originalText": "• An approval, a question or a stuck run waited on the\nterminal's keyboard (a promise in memory).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_177",
      "x": 94,
      "y": 2267.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "• Restart the daemon and those waiting runs were lost.",
      "originalText": "• Restart the daemon and those waiting runs were lost.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_178",
      "x": 94,
      "y": 2290.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "• No window or menu bar could see or answer anything.",
      "originalText": "• No window or menu bar could see or answer anything.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
