      "x": 639,
      "y": 2290.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "• One API, two doors: the window, the menu bar and\nnotifications all use it.",
      "originalText": "• One API, two doors: the window, the menu bar and\nnotifications all use it.",
