      "x": 639,
      "y": 2333.75,
      "width": 487,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "• Log files in ~/Library/Logs/Shadow; a runs list with\nstatus and cost.",
      "originalText": "• Log files in ~/Library/Logs/Shadow; a runs list with\nstatus and cost.",
